   * 鏀寔澶氳疆瀵硅瘽鈥斺€斾紶鍏ュ畬鏁寸殑 messages 鏁扮粍锛堜笉鍚?system锛夛紝
   * system 鎻愮ず璇嶅崟鐙紶鍏ュ苟鑷姩鎻掑叆娑堟伅鍒楄〃澶撮儴銆俓r
   * @param systemPrompt 绯荤粺鎻愮ず璇峔r
   * @param messages 瀵硅瘽鍘嗗彶锛坲ser/assistant 浜ゆ浛锛屼笉鍚?system锛塡r
   * @param opts.model 鍙€夎鐩栨ā鍨嬪悕锛堥粯璁や娇鐢?chatModel锛塡r
   * @param opts.reasoningEffort 鎺ㄧ悊寮哄害锛圽

 | "max"锛夛紝浠?reasoner 妯″瀷鏈夋晥
   * @returns LLM 杩斿洖鐨勬枃鏈唴瀹筡r
   */
  async directChat(
    systemPrompt: string,
    messages: LlmMessage[],
    opts?: { model?: string; reasoningEffort?: "high" | "max" },
  ): Promise<string> {
    const l = this.llm;
    if (!l) throw new Error("LLM 鏈厤缃€斺€旇璁剧疆 DEEPSEEK_API_KEY 鐜鍙橀噺");
    const model = opts?.model ?? l.chatModel;
    const resp = await l.chat(
      model,
      [{ role: "system", content: systemPrompt }, ...messages],
      undefined,
      opts?.reasoningEffort,
    );
    return resp.content ?? "";
  }

  /** 鑾峰彇 AgentPool锛堣交閲忔ā寮忎娇鐢?MiniAgentPool锛岄厤缃┍鍔ㄦā寮忎娇鐢ㄧ湡瀹?AgentPool锛?*/
