    }

    // 闄嶇骇璺緞锛氭棤 Pool 鏃舵牎楠屾湰鍦版祦杞悎娉曟€r
    const allowed = VALID_TRANSITIONS[this._localStatus];
    if (!allowed?.has(status)) {
      const msg = `[${this._tag}] 闈炴硶娴佽浆 ${this._localStatus} 鈫?${status}锛堟棤 Pool 闄嶇骇璺緞锛塦;
      if (this._safeReporter) {
