 *   - 搂11.2 绾嚱鏁伴鏍硷細validate 涓嶄慨鏀瑰閮ㄧ姸鎬乗n */

import type { PolicyRule, PolicyRuleResult } from "../types.js";
import type { PolicyValidatorComponent } from "../ruleEngine.js";

// ============================================================
// 鍛藉悕绾﹀畾閰嶇疆
